  "construction": "The source ConnectednessShadow is a finite non-exponent-two-style condition, not topological connectedness. Construct cyclic regular permutation matrices, their squares and identity. Both C3 and C4 have non-exponent-two elements, so excluding signs still does not select a circle. Output layout: shift_n²;square_n²;identity_n²;n;exponent_two;non_exponent_two",
